{
  "id": "E328",
  "title": "I Miss You",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2019-05-25",
  "synopsis": "How do you tell other people “I miss you”?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1054/91ea5eaaa3e10504cc961fd31b1561e2172ef465.mp3?1560936293",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我想你\n\n何京：喂，亲爱的，我想你了。你在做什么呢？\n丽丽：我在看电视。我也想你了。你这次出差怎么这么久啊？\n何京：我也没办法，工作没做完。\n丽丽：好吧。你回来以后来我家吃饭吧？我的爸爸妈妈也很想你。\n何京：好啊，这么久没去，我也挺想他们的。",
    "traditional": "我想你\n\n何京：喂，親愛的，我想你了。你在做什麼呢？\n麗麗：我在看電視。我也想你了。你這次出差怎麼這麼久啊？\n何京：我也沒辦法，工作沒做完。\n麗麗：好吧。你回來以後來我家吃飯吧？我的爸爸媽媽也很想你。\n何京：好啊，這麼久沒去，我也挺想他們的。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I Miss You"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "何京：喂，亲爱的，我想你了。你在做什么呢？",
      "traditional": "何京：喂，親愛的，我想你了。你在做什麼呢？",
      "pinyin": "hé jīng wéi qīn ài de wǒ xiǎng nǐ le nǐ zài zuò shén me ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "He Jing: Hello, darling. I miss you. What are you doing?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我在看电视。我也想你了。你这次出差怎么这么久啊？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我在看電視。我也想你了。你這次出差怎麼這麼久啊？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ zài kàn diàn shì wǒ yě xiǎng nǐ le nǐ zhè cì chū chāi zěn me zhè me jiǔ a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: I’m watching TV. I miss you too. Why is your business trip taking so long this time?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "何京：我也没办法，工作没做完。",
      "traditional": "何京：我也沒辦法，工作沒做完。",
      "pinyin": "hé jīng wǒ yě méi bàn fǎ gōng zuò méi zuò wán",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "He Jing: I really can’t do anything about it, the work isn’t finished."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丽丽：好吧。你回来以后来我家吃饭吧？我的爸爸妈妈也很想你。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：好吧。你回來以後來我家吃飯吧？我的爸爸媽媽也很想你。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì hǎo ba nǐ huí lái yǐ hòu lái wǒ jiā chī fàn ba wǒ de bà ba mā ma yě hěn xiǎng nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Fine. Do you want to come over for dinner when you are back? My dad and mom also miss you a lot."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "何京：好啊，这么久没去，我也挺想他们的。",
      "traditional": "何京：好啊，這麼久沒去，我也挺想他們的。",
      "pinyin": "hé jīng hǎo a zhè me jiǔ méi qù wǒ yě tǐng xiǎng tā men de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "He Jing: Sure, I haven’t been there for this long, I also really miss them."
    }
  ],
